,"activity",36.10278,-115.17833,"T-Mobile Arena, 3780 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","NHL (ice hockey) team that made it all the way to the Stanley Cup Final in its first season in 2017–18 (though losing), and lifted the Cup in its sixth season in 2022–23. The city's first team in one of the \"big four\" professional…"],["Professional Bull Riders World Finals","activity",36.10278,-115.17833,"T-Mobile Arena","","","","","r","Another major rodeo event is the finals of the Professional Bull Riders series, a separate circuit dedicated to bull riding. The PBR finals, held in late October/early November at the T-Mobile Arena, have more of an international flavor…"],["Bellagio Conservatory and Botanical Gardens","sight",36.1127,-115.177,"3600 S. Las Vegas Blvd","24 hours","","","","r","Inside of the casino is a display of trees and flower arrangements, changed once for every season and once for the Chinese New Year."],["Flamingo Garden","sight",36.1165,-115.1701,"3555 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","A 15-acre garden with flamingos and other exotic birds, as well as koi and turtles."],["Eiffel Tower Experience","sight",36.1124,-115.1721,"Paris Las Vegas, 3655 S Las Vegas Blvd","Mon-Fri 9:30AM-12:30AM, Sat Sun 9:30AM-1AM","","","","r","You can take an elevator to the top of the Eiffel Tower on the Strip, a half-sized replica of the one in Paris. This is a popular attraction, especially at night, for its excellent views of the Strip."],["Stripper 101","activity",36.1106,-115.1691,"V Theater, 3663 Las Vegas Strip","","","","","r","Pole dancing classes. For ladies aged 18 and over only. Advanced booking required. Pole provided."],["\"O\"","activity",36.1138,-115.1771,"Bellagio, 3600 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","The stage at the Bellagio contains a 1.5-million gallon swimming pool, from which most performers emerge and retreat to. It's an incredibly impressive show."],["KÀ","activity",36.1031,-115.1702,"MGM Grand, 3799 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","Spectacular show that tells a tale of imperial twins on a journey to fulfill their destinies. Runs for 90 minutes."],["Absinthe","activity",36.1153,-115.174,"Caesars Palace, 3570 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","A carnival themed mix of comedy, acrobats, and provocative performances. Filled with blue comedy, not for the timid. Adults only."],["Comedy Pet Theater","activity",36.1096,-115.1714,"V Theater, Planet Hollywood","Thu thru Tue at 4PM","","","","r","Extraordinary talents of performing pets. Highly entertaining for children."],["V - The Ultimate Variety Show","activity",36.1107,-115.1697,"V Theater, Planet Hollywood","Nightly 7PM & 8:30PM","","","","r","Includes magic, special effects, death-defying stunts, wild comedy, visual artists."],["Vegas! The Show","activity",36.1098,-115.1698,"Planet Hollywood, 3663 Las Vegas Blvd S","7PM and 9PM nightly, except Sun","","","","r","A trip back to the swank days of Frank, Dino and Sammy features a tap dance number, a tribute to Gladys Knight and a performance of the Can-Can."],["Sin City Comedy Show","activity",36.1099,-115.1703,"Sin City Theater, Planet Hollywood","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"],["Hitzville The Show","activity",36.1097,-115.1689,"V Theater, Planet Hollywood, 3663 Las Vegas Blvd S, Ste. 360","5:30PM daily except Sun","","","","r","Includes the Motown hits of Gladys Knight & The Pips, The Temptations, Tina Turner, The Four Tops and Motown diva Diana Ross & The Supremes as they rock the stage."],["David Copperfield","activity",36.1021,-115.1704,"MGM Grand","","","","","r","One of the world's most famous magicians. Some of his best known illusions are making the Statue of Liberty disappear, walking through the Great Wall of China and flying over the audience (which he does nightly)."],["The Mentalist","activity",36.11041,-115.16977,"V Theater, Planet Hollywood","Nightly except Wed at 7:30PM","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"],["Nathan Burton Comedy Magic","activity",36.1091,-115.1689,"Saxe Theater, Planet Hollywood","Daily 4PM","","","","r","Comedy and magic, family friendly."],["Mat Franco - Magic Reinvented Nightly","activity",36.1185,-115.1712,"Mat Franco Theater, LINQ","nightly 7PM and 9:30PM except Wed and Thu","","","","r","Family friendly comedy and magic in an intimate setting from winner of America’s Got Talent Season 9."],["X Burlesque","activity",36.1161,-115.1717,"Flamingo","Nightly at 10PM, 90 minutes","","","","r","Showcases a variety of performances by six gorgeous dancers set to contemporary music. Combines high-energy performance with the use of props such as bathtubs, guitars, lollipops and feather boas."],["Vegas Golden Knights","activity",36.10278,-115.17833,"T-Mobile Arena, 3780 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","NHL (ice hockey) team that made it all the way to the Stanley Cup Final in its first season in 2017–18 (though losing), and lifted the Cup in 2023. The city's first team in one of the \"big four\" professional sports of the US and Canada,…"],["Ocean One","restaurant",36.10894,-115.17031,"3667 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","Surprisingly inexpensive lunches for a restaurant on the strip. Not fine dining by any means, but a filling and tasty meal if you're trying not to break the bank."],["Jimmy Buffett's Margaritaville","restaurant",36.1173,-115.1724,"Flamingo, 3555 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","A fun tropical-themed restaurant featuring dishes named after many of Jimmy Buffett's songs (for example: the Cheeseburger in Paradise). At happy hour from 5-6PM they have beer for $0.05."],["Amalfi by Bobby Flay","restaurant",36.117,-115.1749,"Caesars Palace, 3570 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","With a brightly colored decor and festive atmosphere, chef Bobby Flay serves us some tasty Southwestern food with flair."],["Strip House","restaurant",36.11007,-115.1725,"3667 Las Vegas Blvd. South","Daily 5PM-11PM","","","","r","Prime cuts of beef, sides, an extensive wine list and desserts based on the New York Strip House."],["Craftsteak","restaurant",36.1024,-115.1686,"MGM Grand, 3799 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","Considered to be one of the best steak houses in America."],["L'Atelier de Joël Robuchon","restaurant",36.1025,-115.1706,"MGM Grand, 3799 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","Sophisticated French Michelin-starred restaurant with dim lighting, ruby red furniture, and spectacular food."],["Casa Fuente Cigars","bar",36.1196,-115.1736,"Caesars Palace, 3500 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","Cuban-themed lounge offering more than 100 different cigars and a good selection of whiskeys. Try the $40 Opus X cigar."],["Nine Fine Irishmen","bar",36.1019,-115.1737,"New York-New York, 3790 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","This pub was constructed in Ireland and then shipped to Las Vegas. A great Irish band plays most nights starting around 9PM, the crowd is always energetic, and the Guinness and Bass flow easily."],["Showgirl Bar","bar",36.1109,-115.1705,"Planet Hollywood, 3663 S Las Vegas Blvd","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"]]}